$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=dchrgsefsum  LOC_AFTER=?

* The shifted Gauss sum (Mathlib gaussSum chi ( stdAddChar.mulShift A )) in the exp form equals the root-of-unity form.

s1::simpl |- ( ( N e. NN /\ A e. ZZ ) -> N e. NN )
s2:s1:adantr |- ( ( ( N e. NN /\ A e. ZZ ) /\ a e. ( 0 ..^ N ) ) -> N e. NN )
